{"pageid": 898, "title": "Black Mask", "revid": 2703, "categories": ["Black Masks", "Lore", "Masks", "Monster hunters", "Order of St. George"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/df/Black_Mask.png/revision/latest?cb=20241130215907\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Black Mask of the North American Houses.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"98\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Black Mask.png\" data-image-key=\"Black_Mask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/df/Black_Mask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241130215907\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/df/Black_Mask.png/revision/latest?cb=20241130215907\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Black Mask of the North American Houses.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/df/Black_Mask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241130215907\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"98\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Black Mask.png\" data-image-key=\"Black_Mask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/df/Black_Mask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241130215907\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Black_Mask.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The Black Mask of the North American Houses.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;padding:10px 10px;\">“\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:4px 10px;\"><i>Black Masks learn things out here, in the field, on our own. Most important thing about being a Black Mask is knowing when it's best to follow the Order's rules... and when not to.</i>\n</td>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;padding:10px 10px;\">”\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"line-height:1em;text-align: right\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">&#8212; Louis Boucher, <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Butcher_1\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1\">Book of Butcher</a></i></cite></div><i></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Black Masks</b> are a branch of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a> who don the color black and hunt <a href=\"/wiki/Monsters\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monsters\">monsters</a> independently. Usually known to have rivalries with the group-oriented <a href=\"/wiki/White_Masks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"White Masks\">White Masks</a>, the Black Masks are often the smallest branch of each House, and lead solitary and isolating lives.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;padding:10px 10px;\">“\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:4px 10px;\"><i>Black Masks are the lone hunters of the Order of St. George. They are trained to be self-sufficient in the field, capable of taking down a monster without House assistance. The training is more rigorous, lonely work, and the heads of the Black Mask branch work diligently to only pick those suited to the solitary life required of them.</i>\n</td>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;padding:10px 10px;\">”\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"line-height:1em;text-align: right\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">&#8212; <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\">The Book of Slaughter</a></i></cite></div><i></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The Black Masks are known as the solo hunters of the Order. Trained separate from the White Masks, they are taught to function independently and be able to take down monsters on their own, rather than relying on group attacks. As such, they are often sent on missions alone, and lead solitary lives with little attachments. Few Black Mack trainees survive <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Sacrament of the Hunt (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX1NhY3JhbWVudF9vZl90aGVfSHVudD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">the Sacrament of the Hunt</span>, as they are not allowed to rely on others in their hunt, but many of them can easily pass <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Sacrament of Trepanation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX1NhY3JhbWVudF9vZl9UcmVwYW5hdGlvbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">the Blind Hunt</span> as they have been operating without help for most of their lives.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Some consider those under this mask to have \"the most thankless job\" in the Order.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC20&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC20-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Black Masks, as lone hunters, are often also the most skeptical of Order rules, hierarchy, and orders. Specifically, they are expected to learn in the field, change their worldview with new information, and decide when to follow orders and when to ignore them.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOB&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOB-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>They tend to have rivalries with the <a href=\"/wiki/White_Masks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"White Masks\">White Masks</a>, as their ways of hunting often clash with each other. However, White Masks often find solo missions difficult or deadly, and Black Masks have trouble working in social environments or on team hunts, so both are considered valuable to the Order.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Black_Masks\">Known Black Masks</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"House_of_Boucher\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Boucher (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfQm91Y2hlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">House of Boucher</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"René Boucher (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmVuJUMzJUE5X0JvdWNoZXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">René Boucher</span> †</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Louis Boucher (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTG91aXNfQm91Y2hlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Louis Boucher</span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"House_of_Carnage\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Carnage (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfQ2FybmFnZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">House of Carnage</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Julien Carnage (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSnVsaWVuX0Nhcm5hZ2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Julien Carnage</span> † (d. 8/14/1666)</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Angelique Carnage (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQW5nZWxpcXVlX0Nhcm5hZ2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Angelique Carnage</span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"House_of_Cutter\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Cutter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfQ3V0dGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">House of Cutter</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Brutus Cutter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQnJ1dHVzX0N1dHRlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Brutus Cutter</span> † (d. 8/14/1666)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a> †</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"George Cutter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR2VvcmdlX0N1dHRlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">George Cutter</span> <small>(preparing for retirement)</small></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"House_of_Slaughter\"><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Samuel Cutter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2FtdWVsX0N1dHRlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Samuel Slaughter</span> † <small><i>(founder)</i></small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Adda_Slaughter\" title=\"Adda Slaughter\">Adda Slaughter</a> †</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica Slaughter</a> †</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron Slaughter</a> † <small>(last known leader)</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> <small>(defected)</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a> <small>(training abroad)</small></li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a> is also noted to have begun her training as a Black Mask, before switching to White.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"3695bfd2f3b60943e52e533b4e452954\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Black_Mask-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:100px; width:185px; top:42.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Black_Mask.png\" title=\"Black Mask.png (481 KB)\" style=\"height:100px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/df/Black_Mask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241130215907\" title=\"Black Mask.png (481 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"The Black Mask of the American Houses.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Black Mask.png\" data-image-key=\"Black_Mask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"The Black Mask of the American Houses.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Black Mask.png (481 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"The Black Mask of the American Houses.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Black Mask.png\" data-image-key=\"Black_Mask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"The Black Mask of the American Houses.\" data-sr